                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/758: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-17T16:00:00-02:00">January 17, 1933—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 17—2:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7. Brazilian Foreign Office states Colombian ships have left Manãos today but
                    will stop at Teffe if Peru’s attitude is modified. Peru’s reply to Brazil’s note
                    which was handed in at Lima has not arrived.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
